        "# EAFP\n",
        "\n",
        "“Easier to ask forgiveness than permission” is a style that attempts an operation and handles exceptions if it fails, rather than checking every precondition first.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-EAFP)"
